<title>USA: Hamilton North Library, Ind., won by NatCity.</title>
<headline>Hamilton North Library, Ind., won by NatCity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatCity Investments said it won $3.200 million of Hamilton North Public Library Holding Corp, Ind., first mortgage bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
